  "description": "Closed movement segment s=8+4t for0<=t<=4, from(0,8) to(4,24). Horizontal axis t(h), vertical s(km), basic numeric ticks. This is an authored mathematical representation of the written travel data. Replace the generic reference x/y axes with physically meaningful t/s axes and units; no formula label or queried-point annotations.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "Closed movement segment s=8+4t for0<=t<=4, from(0,8) to(4,24). Horizontal axis t(h), vertical s(km), basic numeric ticks. This is an authored mathematical representation of the written travel data. Replace the generic reference x/y axes with physically meaningful t/s axes and units; no formula label or queried-point annotations. This is newly authored mathematics, not a recovered original. Figure 77 was visually inspected only for general axes styling and is not provenance. Numeric scales, plotting windows and panel layout are deliberate authored additions. No formula is printed on the graph.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "exercise": "313",
        "text": "一队旅行者经过 $A$ 地后，现在正在离 $A$ 地 $8$ 公里处。如果他们步行的速度是 $4$ 公里/小时，步行 $t\\ (0\\le t\\le4)$ 小时后，他们离 $A$ 地的距离 $s$ 是多少公里？用式表示 $s$ 对$t$ 的依赖关系，并作出运动的图象。根据图象求：\na) 经过 $1.5$ 小时、$2.5$ 小时、$3$ 小时后，旅行者和 $A$ 地的距离是多少公里。\nb) 经过几小时以后，旅行者可以到达离 $A$ 地 $12$ 公里远的 $B$ 地和离 $A$ 地 $20$ 公里远的 $C$ 地？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "一般地，式 $y=kx+l$ 给出的函数的图象是直线。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "我们知道，作一条直线只要确定直线上两个点的位置就行了。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "如果线性函数的定义域不包括所有的数，那么它的图象是直线上点的子集（例如，射线、线段、离散点的集合）。"
      }
    ],
